I still have not smelled Ambre Narguile, it’s very difficult to find unless you are willing to pay retail. Apart from that, I still think AS is the best option of this style I tried because it adds a lot of woodiness and tones down the vanilla.
In general I’m not too much into this scent profile, that’s the reason I’m in no rush to get the Hermes.

